#indent 4

//: # codegen/memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_gate
//: memo_call backend request に PrivateCache proof record を[結/むす]び[付/つ]ける checker/codegen boundary です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - `memo_call_backend_preflight` は、HIR root から memoized backend request を内部収集し、PrivateCache proof が未接続の非空 request を fail-closed に止めます。この module はその次段として、caller が渡す proof table をそのまま authority にせず、HIR root から request table を再構築したうえで proof key を厳密に照合します。
//: - memoized function value を backend lowering へ進めるためには、source function identity、memoized occurrence、root body、body module fingerprint が同じ PrivateCache proof によって裏付けられている必要があります。この条件を typed key と enum status で表し、表示名や source token に依存しない境界として固定します。
//: - proof が揃っている場合でも、この stage は実行可能な backend plan ではなく、non-executable summary だけを返します。cache allocation、lookup、insert、sealed representation、Wasm / LLVM bytes は後続 stage が別の proof boundary で扱います。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - public entrypoint は borrowed `SelfhostHirModule`、root expression id、traversal fuel、body module fingerprint、borrowed proof table だけを受け取ります。caller supplied request table は受け取りません。
//: - request table は `selfhost_memo_call_backend_request_table_from_hir_root_result` で内部構築し、各 entry は `memoized_expr_id` から HIR expression を引き直して request builder を再実行します。
//: - accepted proof key は `memoized_expr_id`、`source_function_def_id`、`function_ty`、`root_expr_id`、`body_module_fingerprint`、`request_kind`、`source_effect`、`type_arg_count`、`proof_kind`、`proof_schema_version` の完全一致を要求します。`SelfhostDefId` や `SelfhostTypeId` だけの proof reuse は認めません。
//: - `body_module_fingerprint == 0` は placeholder origin なので、非空 request に対する key と proof record として拒否します。
//: - proof status が `RequestEvidenceProven` の場合だけ accepted summary の `proven_request_count` を増やします。この status は「この module 内 gate に必要な request occurrence evidence が producer-owned path から渡された」ことだけを表し、PrivateCache effect masking や Resource no-escape proof の完了を意味しません。
//: - missing、`RequestEvidenceRefuted`、duplicate、root request に対応しない orphan proof は typed error として fail-closed にします。
//: - diagnostic symbol、diagnostic span、関数名、`memo_call` という文字列、source text は proof lookup や accepted 判定の authority ではありません。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - proof table は session-local owner table です。永続 `.neplproof` / `.neplobj` artifact ではありません。永続 artifact key へ投影するには、module source identity、typed public surface hash、policy hash、stable type argument identity を別 boundary で合成する必要があります。
//: - PrivateCache / PrivateState internal effect の fold、Resource IR no-escape proof 生成、cache hit / miss observation ban、function identity observation ban、sealed cache backend representation は未接続です。この module は、それらが存在しない状態で backend bytes を作らないための request-evidence gate だけを担当します。
//: - Phase 1 では proof record / proof table / proof table writer / gate 本体は module-private です。後続の Resource proof producer が接続されるまでは、外部 module が arbitrary `RequestEvidenceProven` record を table に注入したり、その table を accepted gate に渡したりできないようにします。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - request collection と HIR 再照合は root subtree の expression 数を `n`、memoized request 数を `m` とすると O(n + m) 時間です。
//: - proof lookup は現状、request ごとに proof table を線形走査するため proof record 数を `p` とすると O(m * p) 時間です。
//: - sorted index 化、root / fingerprint bucket 化、stable artifact sidecar index は、この exact key / duplicate rejection / fail-closed status contract を保ったまま後続 stage で置換できます。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/codegen/memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_gate" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     match selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_gate_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check_eq_i32 1 summary.accepted_request_count
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check_eq_i32 1 summary.accepted_proof_count
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_gate_missing_result_eq summary.missing_rejected selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_gate_stage0_expected_key
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_gate_refuted_result_eq summary.refuted_rejected selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_gate_stage0_expected_key
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks4
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _setup:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "memo_call private cache proof gate stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/collections/vec" as v
#import "core/field" as field
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/option" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "neplg2/core/hir/hir" as *
#import "neplg2/core/infra/span" as *
#import "neplg2/core/resolve/name_resolver" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/effect" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty" as *
#import "./memo_call_backend_request" as *
#import "./memo_call_backend_request_table" as *

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus: memo_call PrivateCache request-evidence の[状態/じょうたい]
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - gate が要求する request occurrence evidence の成功と反証を bool に潰さず、match の網羅性検査で分岐できるようにします。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `RequestEvidenceProven` はこの gate の入力 record が request occurrence と一致したことを表すだけです。PrivateCache region の non-escape、effect masking、backend cache correctness を証明した status として扱ってはいけません。
enum SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus:
    RequestEvidenceProven
    RequestEvidenceRefuted

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind: proof record が何を証明する record かを示す分類
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - 将来 `PrivateCacheRegionNoEscape` や `NoObservation` などの proof が増えたとき、request occurrence gate 用 record と混同しないようにします。
pub enum SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind:
    RequestOccurrenceGateEvidence

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey: memo_call PrivateCache proof と request を[結/むす]び[付/つ]ける key
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `memoized_expr_id` は同じ source function を複数回 memoize した occurrence を区別します。
//: - `source_function_def_id` と `function_ty` は HIR leaf の function identity から得た typed evidence です。
//: - `root_expr_id` と `body_module_fingerprint` は session-local HIR id の origin を縛り、別 root / 別 module の proof reuse を防ぎます。
//: - `request_kind`、`source_effect`、`type_arg_count` は request manifest の semantic field を key に含め、generic request や impure source を別 proof として扱います。
//: - `proof_kind` と `proof_schema_version` は、この record が request occurrence gate 用 evidence であることと key shape を明示します。後続の no-escape proof や identity-observation proof と混同してはいけません。
pub struct SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey:
    memoized_expr_id %SelfhostHirExprId
    source_function_def_id %SelfhostDefId
    function_ty %SelfhostTypeId
    root_expr_id %SelfhostHirExprId
    body_module_fingerprint %i32
    request_kind %SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestKind
    source_effect %SelfhostEffectKind
    type_arg_count %i32
    proof_kind %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind
    proof_schema_version %i32

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord: 1 つの memo_call proof status
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - record は proof producer が対象にした request key と、その gate-evidence status だけを保持します。
//: - `RequestEvidenceProven` 以外の status は accepted summary を作りません。
struct SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord:
    key %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey
    status %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable: memo_call PrivateCache proof record の owner table
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `records` は owner buffer です。この table 自体に `Clone` / `Copy` を実装してはいけません。
//: - table は module-private です。外部 module は proof record owner buffer を直組みして accepted gate へ渡せません。
struct SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable:
    records %Vec SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary: proof gate の accepted summary
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - この summary は backend bytes ではなく、同じ HIR root 由来の memoized request が proof table で裏付けられたことだけを表します。
pub struct SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary:
    request_count %i32
    proven_request_count %i32

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary: proof gate smoke の代表結果
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - accepted proof、missing proof、refuted proof を 1 つの doctest で確認できるようにします。
pub struct SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary:
    accepted_request_count %i32
    accepted_proof_count %i32
    missing_rejected %Result i32 SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind
    refuted_rejected %Result i32 SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind: proof gate の失敗分類
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - request collection、HIR 再照合、proof table construction、proof lookup、refuted proof を表示文ではなく enum payload として返します。
pub enum SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind:
    RequestCollectionFailed %SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestCollectorErrorKind
    RequestEntryMissing %i32
    RequestExpressionMissing %SelfhostHirExprId
    RequestRecheckRejected %SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestRejection
    RequestIdentityMismatch %SelfhostHirExprId
    BodyModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
    ProofTableAllocFailed %StdErrorKind
    ProofRecordPushFailed %StdErrorKind
    ProofRecordReadFailed %i32
    ProofMissing %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey
    ProofRefuted %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey
    ProofDuplicate %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey
    ProofOrphan %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey
    Stage0FixtureAllocFailed %StdErrorKind

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateSummary \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateStage0Summary \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_schema_version: gate proof key schema の version を[返/かえ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - schema version は永続 artifact ABI ではありません。この module 内の request-evidence key shape を区別するための session-local constant です。
pub fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_schema_version %fn void i32 \void:
    1

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_new: proof key を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - caller は request manifest から得た semantic field を渡します。この関数は proof kind と schema version を module 内 constant で補い、外部 caller が別 kind / 別 schema の key を合成できないようにします。
//: - `body_module_fingerprint == 0` の拒否は table push と request-entry key 生成側で行います。この constructor は field を正規の順序で束ねるだけです。
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_new %fn SelfhostHirExprId fn SelfhostDefId fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostHirExprId fn i32 fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestKind fn SelfhostEffectKind fn i32 SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey \memoized_expr_id\source_function_def_id\function_ty\root_expr_id\body_module_fingerprint\request_kind\source_effect\type_arg_count:
    SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey memoized_expr_id source_function_def_id function_ty root_expr_id body_module_fingerprint request_kind source_effect type_arg_count SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind::RequestOccurrenceGateEvidence selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_schema_version

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_record_new: proof record を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_record_new %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord \key\status:
    SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord key status

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_new: [空/から]の proof table を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_new %impure fn void Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind \void:
    let records_result %Result Vec SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord StdErrorKind v::new
    match records_result:
        Result::Ok records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable records
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind::ProofTableAllocFailed e

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_free: proof table の owner buffer を[閉/と]じる
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_free %impure fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable unit \table:
    v::free field::get table "records"

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_len: proof record 数を[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_len %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable i32 \table:
    let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord field::get_ref table "records"
    v::len records

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_push: proof record を table に[追加/ついか]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `body_module_fingerprint == 0` の record は placeholder origin なので拒否し、table owner を閉じます。
//: - push 失敗時は `Vec` が返した owner を閉じ、lower `StdErrorKind` を保持します。
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_push %impure fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable impure fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind \table\record:
    if:
        eq record.key.body_module_fingerprint 0
        then:
            selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_free table
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind::BodyModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
        else:
            let records %Vec SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord field::get table "records"
            match v::push records record:
                Result::Ok next_records:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable next_records
                Result::Err e:
                    let error %StdErrorKind field::get e "error"
                    v::free v::vec_push_error_vec e
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind::ProofRecordPushFailed error

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_status_eq: proof status が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_status_eq %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus::RequestEvidenceProven:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus::RequestEvidenceProven:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus::RequestEvidenceRefuted:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus::RequestEvidenceRefuted:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus::RequestEvidenceProven:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus::RequestEvidenceRefuted:
                    true

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_kind_eq: proof kind が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind::RequestOccurrenceGateEvidence:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKind::RequestOccurrenceGateEvidence:
                    true

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_request_kind_eq: request kind が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_request_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestKind fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestKind::MemoCall:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestKind::MemoCall:
                    true

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_eq: proof key が同じ request boundary を指すか[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_eq %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey bool \a\b:
    and:
        eq selfhost_hir_expr_id_index a.memoized_expr_id selfhost_hir_expr_id_index b.memoized_expr_id
        and:
            selfhost_def_id_eq a.source_function_def_id b.source_function_def_id
            and:
                selfhost_type_id_eq a.function_ty b.function_ty
                and:
                    eq selfhost_hir_expr_id_index a.root_expr_id selfhost_hir_expr_id_index b.root_expr_id
                    and:
                        eq a.body_module_fingerprint b.body_module_fingerprint
                        and:
                            selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_request_kind_eq a.request_kind b.request_kind
                            and:
                                selfhost_effect_kind_eq a.source_effect b.source_effect
                                and:
                                    eq a.type_arg_count b.type_arg_count
                                    and:
                                        selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_kind_eq a.proof_kind b.proof_kind
                                        eq a.proof_schema_version b.proof_schema_version

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_from_entry_result: request entry から proof key を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_from_entry_result %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendRequestTableEntry fn SelfhostHirExprId fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind \entry\root_expr_id\body_module_fingerprint:
    if:
        eq body_module_fingerprint 0
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind::BodyModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
        else:
            Result::Ok selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_new entry.memoized_expr_id entry.request.source_function_def_id entry.request.function_ty root_expr_id body_module_fingerprint entry.request.request_kind entry.request.source_effect entry.request.type_arg_count

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_finish: proof lookup の最終状態を[畳/たた]む
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_finish %fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey fn Option SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind \key\found:
    match found:
        Option::Some status:
            Result::Ok status
        Option::None:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind::ProofMissing key

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_loop: proof table から matching status を[探/さが]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - matching proof が 2 件以上ある場合は `ProofDuplicate` として拒否します。record order による first-wins は使いません。
fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_loop %fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofTable fn SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey fn i32 fn Option SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofStatus SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind \proofs\key\idx\found:
    if:
        ge idx selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_table_len proofs
        then:
            selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_finish key found
        else:
            let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofRecord field::get_ref proofs "records"
            match v::get records idx:
                Option::Some record:
                    if:
                        selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_key_eq record.key key
                        then:
                            match found:
                                Option::Some _existing:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind::ProofDuplicate key
                                Option::None:
                                    selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_loop proofs key add idx 1 some record.status
                        else:
                            selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_loop proofs key add idx 1 found
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofGateErrorKind::ProofRecordReadFailed idx

//: selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_proof_lookup_result: key に対応する proof status を[返/かえ]す
